			Andreas Schulz
		</p>
		<h2>
			(Germany - 3 March 1955)
		</h2>
		<p>
			Andreas Schulz works at Ralliart Germany. In 1995 he took part in a World Rally
			Championship season that was successful for Mitsubishi, ending with his victory in Group N
			in a Lancer Evolution III. Andreas Schulz worked with Jorge Recalde
			and with Isolde Holderied, who won the Ladies Cup twice. During the 1995 season
			he took part in all the rallies apart from the RAC Rally in Great Britain.
